    Bug 1976783 - Use EnsureNSSInitializedChromeOrContent instead of XPCOM methods. r=kaie
    I had intended to use `components::NSSComponent::Service()` for this but debug builds didn't like
    it. I think the compiler optimised it away. But `EnsureNSSInitializedChromeOrContent` exists and
    seems to be specifically for what we want.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D257960

